= Viktor Chernov to resign!

Viktor Chernov, the leader of the Socialist-Revolutionaries, has announced his intent to resign by the end of the year. We should lobby for a pro-Menshevik candidate if possible, good relations or a left-leaning PSR could go a long way in the future.

- @lobby
- @lobbybig
- @root: We have no interest in lobbying for the Esers at this time.

